   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till International Social Science Council f&#xf6;r produktionen av World Social Science Report 2010 med temat Knowledge Divides. Rapporten produceras p&#xe5; uppdrag av UNESCO och ambitionen &#xe4;r att den ska ges ut periodiskt, parallellt med den naturvetenskapliga rapport som produceras av UNESCO.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to International Social Science Council for the production of World Social Science Report 2010 with the theme Knowledge Divides. The report is commissioned by UNESCO and the ambition is that it will be published periodically, in parallell with the natural science report produced by UNESCO.</narrative>
